OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786639677
OL,3,CSuspended Birmingham Green Councillor
OL,4,Carrested on suspicion of harassment
OL,6,FBirmingham councillor Siobhan Harper-
OL,7,FNunes has been arrested on suspicion
OL,8,Fof harassment, just days after she was
OL,9,Fcharged with assaulting five people.
OL,11,FWest Midlands Police confirmed the 66-
OL,12,Fyear-old was arrested at a property in
OL,13,FMonument Road, Birmingham, on
OL,14,FWednesday morning (12 August).
OL,16,FShe remains in police custody while
OL,17,Fenquiries continue.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/6
