PN,34402
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786639677
OL,3,CSuspended Birmingham Green Councillor
OL,4,Carrested on suspicion of harassment
OL,6,FThe latest arrest comes less than a
OL,7,Fweek after Harper-Nunes was charged
OL,8,Fwith assaulting a member of the
OL,9,Fpublic, three police officers and a
OL,10,Fmember of police staff.
OL,12,FThose charges relate an incident after
OL,13,Fpolice were called to reports of
OL,14,Fdisorder near the junction of Monument
OL,15,FRoad and Hagley Road at around 5pm on
OL,16,FThursday, 6 August.
OL,18,FPolice have not released further
OL,19,Fdetails about the circumstances
OL,20,Fsurrounding the new harassment
OL,21,Fallegation.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G2/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
