PN,34403
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786639677
OL,3,CSuspended Birmingham Green Councillor
OL,4,Carrested on suspicion of harassment
OL,6,FHarper-Nunes was elected in May to
OL,7,Frepresent Ladywood as a Green Party
OL,8,Fcandidate on Birmingham City Council
OL,9,Fand previously stood as the Green
OL,10,FParty's candidate for West Midlands
OL,11,FMayor in 2024.
OL,13,FFollowing the assault charges last
OL,14,Fweek, she was suspended from the Green
OL,15,Fgroup on Birmingham City Council.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G3/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BC Eng News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,345,340,120,260,000,100
PN,34404
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786639677
OL,3,CSuspended Birmingham Green Councillor
OL,4,Carrested on suspicion of harassment
OL,6,FA Birmingham Green Party group
OL,7,Fspokesperson said at the time: "Cllr
OL,8,FSiobhan Harper-Nunes has been
OL,9,Fsuspended from the Green Party Group
OL,10,Fwith immediate effect pending an
OL,11,Finvestigation."
OL,13,FLabour group leader Councillor Nicky
OL,14,FBrennan also called for her to step
OL,15,Faside, saying: "She should do the
OL,16,Fright thing by the people of Ladywood
OL,17,Fand step aside."
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G4/6
OL,2,W+.! +,*%/"-'"-$/*%/*%/.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
