PN,34405
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F344A1786639677
OL,3,CSuspended Birmingham Green Councillor
OL,4,Carrested on suspicion of harassment
OL,6,FFollowing the earlier incident, West
OL,7,FMidlands Police said Harper-Nunes had
OL,8,Fbeen charged with assaulting "a member
OL,9,Fof the public, three police officers
OL,10,Fand a member of police staff".
OL,12,FShe was bailed to appear before
OL,13,FBirmingham Magistrates' Court on 10
OL,14,FSeptember in relation to those charges.
OL,16,FIn its latest update, West Midlands
OL,17,FPolice said: "A 66-year-old woman was
OL,18,Farrested at a property in Monument
OL,19,FRoad, Birmingham, this morning (12
OL,20,FAug) on suspicion of harassment.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G5/6
